/// Static, human- and agent-readable documentation of the public backend API.
/// The document is a compile-time literal and reads no actor state.
mixin () {
  /// Return the backend API documentation as Markdown.
  public query func getApiDoc() : async Text {
    let lines : [Text] = [
      "# Luminous Studios — Backend API",
      "",
      "This canister stores contact-form enquiries submitted from the Luminous Studios",
      "website and exposes them to the studio owner. It also exposes the enquiry table",
      "to the Caffeine Data Intelligence agent through the Object Query Layer (OQL).",
      "",
      "## Authorization surface",
      "",
      "- `submitEnquiry` is **open to any caller**, including anonymous visitors. It is",
      "  the public contact endpoint.",
      "- `listEnquiries` is **admin-only**. A caller without the `#admin` role receives",
      "  a trap: `Unauthorized: Only admins can view enquiries`.",
      "- `getApiDoc` (this method) is a public query and requires no authorization.",
      "- The OQL `enquiry` entity is registered `.controllerOnly()`: only the platform",
      "  controller (and the Data Intelligence agent acting as controller) can read it",
      "  through `schema()` / `execute()`. End users cannot query it directly.",
      "",
      "### Registration prerequisite",
      "",
      "Authorization is provided by the `caffeineai-authorization` component. A caller",
      "is only known to the canister after it has been registered. Registration happens",
      "when a caller signs in through the app's own frontend, which calls",
      "`_initialize_access_control` once. The **first** caller to initialize receives",
      "the `#admin` role; every subsequent caller receives the default (non-admin)",
      "role. A principal that has never signed in through the frontend is unregistered",
      "even if it belongs to the app owner, and a principal derived against a different",
      "Internet Identity derivation origin is a different principal than the one the",
      "frontend registered. An unregistered or anonymous caller hitting `listEnquiries`",
      "receives the trap above.",
      "",
      "The frontend pins an Internet Identity derivation origin, published at",
      "`/.well-known/ii-derivation-origin` when available. An agent already holding the",
      "user's Internet Identity authorization derives the correct per-app principal",
      "against that origin (for example `icp identity link web <name> --app <host>`).",
      "Such a delegation acts with the user's full authority in this app until it",
      "expires.",
      "",
      "## Methods",
      "",
      "### `submitEnquiry(input : EnquiryInput) : async SubmitResult`",
      "",
      "Persist a contact-form enquiry and attempt to notify the studio owner by email.",
      "",
      "`EnquiryInput` fields:",
      "",
      "| Field         | Type    | Required | Notes |",
      "| ------------- | ------- | -------- | ----- |",
      "| `name`        | `Text`  | yes      | Trimmed; must be non-empty. |",
      "| `email`       | `Text`  | yes      | Trimmed; must be non-empty and contain `@` and `.`. |",
      "| `projectType` | `Text`  | yes      | Trimmed; must be non-empty. |",
      "| `description` | `Text`  | yes      | Trimmed; must be non-empty. |",
      "| `budget`      | `?Text` | no       | Optional; stored as submitted. |",
      "",
      "Validation runs server-side and returns the first failing field as",
      "`#err(#invalidInput(reason))` with a human-readable message.",
      "",
      "On success the enquiry is stored and the method returns `#ok(id)`, where `id` is",
      "the stored enquiry's numeric identifier.",
      "",
      "**Notification recipient is a placeholder.** The notification email is sent to",
      "`REPLACE_WITH_BUSINESS_EMAIL`, a clearly marked placeholder. Until the owner",
      "replaces it with a real business address, email delivery will not reach a real",
      "inbox. The integration is intentionally easy to connect: change the",
      "`notificationRecipient` constant in `src/backend/lib/contact.mo`.",
      "",
      "**No false success.** The enquiry is only stored and `#ok` is only returned when",
      "the notification email is sent successfully. If the email cannot be sent, the",
      "method returns `#err(#notificationFailed(reason))` and **nothing is stored** —",
      "callers never see a success for a message that was not delivered.",
      "",
      "**Not idempotent.** A retry of the same input sends another notification and",
      "stores another enquiry with a new id. There is no deduplication; callers should",
      "not blindly retry on an ambiguous outcome.",
      "",
      "### `listEnquiries() : async [Enquiry]`",
      "",
      "Return every stored enquiry, **newest first** (descending by `id`). Admin-only;",
      "see the authorization surface above.",
      "",
      "`Enquiry` fields: `id : Nat`, `name : Text`, `email : Text`,",
      "`projectType : Text`, `description : Text`, `budget : ?Text`,",
      "`submittedAt : Nat`.",
      "",
      "## Units and encoding",
      "",
      "- `id` and `submittedAt` are `Nat` (unsigned integers).",
      "- `submittedAt` is a **nanosecond** Unix timestamp (`Time.now()` on the IC),",
      "  not milliseconds or seconds.",
      "- `budget` is `?Text` — `null` means the visitor did not specify a budget.",
      "- `SubmitResult` is a variant: `#ok(Nat)` or `#err(EnquiryError)`, where",
      "  `EnquiryError` is `#invalidInput(Text)` or `#notificationFailed(Text)`.",
      "",
      "## Lifecycle, polling and retry safety",
      "",
      "- `submitEnquiry` is an update call that performs an outbound HTTP outcall to",
      "  send the notification email; it is not instantaneous. Callers should await the",
      "  result rather than poll.",
      "- `listEnquiries` is a query call and returns the current stored set; there is no",
      "  pagination and no completion state to poll.",
      "- Because `submitEnquiry` is not idempotent, a caller that retries after a",
      "  timeout may create a duplicate enquiry and a duplicate notification.",
      "",
      "## Errors and gotchas",
      "",
      "- `#invalidInput` is a caller-fixable error; surface the message to the visitor.",
      "- `#notificationFailed` means the enquiry was **not** stored. Do not show a",
      "  success state.",
      "- `listEnquiries` traps (rather than returning an error variant) for",
      "  unauthorized callers; the frontend must treat a reject as \"not permitted\".",
      "- The OQL entity is controller-only, so end-user queries against the `enquiry`",
      "  table are rejected; use `listEnquiries` for admin reads.",
    ];
    lines.values().join("\n");
  };
};
